<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Northern Fury 41 - Tour de Force, 1994</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY text=#dcdcdc bgColor=#2b2b2b scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Northern Fury 41 ‘Tour de Force&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;18 March 1994&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;The global war between East and West has been raging for a month, NATO is on the offensive, but the Warsaw Pact is far from defeated and still has the ability to counterattack. The ground war in Europe continues to be brutal and deadly, after Berlin and Copenhagen fell, the Danish Government collapsed but the Germans continue to govern out of Bonn. Danish air and naval forces are generally still fighting alongside NATO counterparts, but they have taken heavy casualties. Aircraft losses in central Europe count in the thousands, troops in the tens of thousands on both sides. Over 100 ships and patrol vessels have been sunk in the Baltic alone. Conflicts in the Caribbean, Mediterranean, Persian Gulf and Indian Ocean have stabilized in NATO’s favour, both the Panama and Suez Canals remain open and navigable. In the Pacific, 7&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet has opened a corridor to Japan through the Philippines and Taiwan, it is tenuous but holding. South Korea is still under constant air threat but some supply and reinforcements, heavily escorted have reached Busan. USS Constellation has retired to San Diego after sustaining heavy losses amongst her air group, which is now operating out of Clark Field. USS New Jersey was struck by 3 torpedoes but limped to Manila where it remains tied up, unlikely to put to sea again.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;You are in command of Strike Fleet North (STRIKFLTNOR) and control all naval and air assets north of the GIUK gap and above the Arctic Circle in Norway. Your boss, Admiral Falkner commanding Strike Fleet Atlantic (STRIKFLTLANT) from shore at Faslane Scotland has given you his command ship (USS Mount Whitney) and most of the offensive power of NATOs Atlantic Fleet.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;You’ve just wrapped up &lt;STRONG&gt;Operation Thor’s Lightning &lt;/STRONG&gt;with a two-carrier strike on the Command and Communications structure in the Narvik area, but we’re not ready for the next major operation yet. You’ve been informed that the amphibious/airborne operation planned for northern Norway is at least two weeks away. Therefore, you have the problem of keeping the pressure on the Soviets without risking any major losses. Of course, &lt;EM&gt;Ivan&lt;/EM&gt; will see this as an opportunity to strike back, he still has lots of ways to do that.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;You’re role in this scenario is one that is seldom depicted in CMO, that of a ‘holding action’. You are not on the defensive, but your offensive actions need to be limited and have the general effect of tying the enemy down for the next 10 days. Physically, you have the capacity to restore cave-dwelling as an acceptable way of life in north Norway – but that would be counterproductive and not fit the overall plan of action for the next month. Going on the attack now would expend tremendous resources, both logistically and in the form of loses, bringing the Strike Fleet to a much weaker state when it is needed to support the amphibious operations in a couple weeks. From a &lt;EM&gt;Principles of War&lt;/EM&gt; perspective; you are conducting an &lt;EM&gt;Economy of Effort&lt;/EM&gt; operation to allow Admiral Falkner (and you in later scenarios) to &lt;EM&gt;Concentrate Force&lt;/EM&gt; and &lt;EM&gt;Maintain the overall aim&lt;/EM&gt; of the campaign.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;This scenario is playable by NATO:&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;You are commanding a Fleet, there are initially four growing to five USN Carrier Battle Groups, augmented by two British CVs and first one then two French CVs. You also have significant logistics forces and one of your main tasks is to replenish your forces and set up for the next major operation. In total there are over 120 vessels and 650 aircraft. The scenario last for 10 days and you will receive new intelligence and further tasks each day.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Designer’s Notes:&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;This is the 41&lt;SUP&gt;st&lt;/SUP&gt; scenario of a campaign. See the Northern Fury background &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;A href="http://northernfury.us/blog/post19/" target=_BLANK&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0080ff&gt;page&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt; for further insight on the background and happenings so far. The key nuggets:&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;UL style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Cold War continued, no thaw in relations. WP still alive and doing very well.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;The 3&lt;SUP&gt;rd&lt;/SUP&gt; World war started 13 Feb. The Warsaw Pact forces led by the Soviet Union attacked NATO and other nations on a global scale. The main blow was in Western Europe but fighting erupted in the Pacific, Caribbean, Middle East and North Africa. India has declared a separate war with Pakistan, North Korea attacked Southwards in an apparently independent move and Argentina is threatening the Falklands again (but has not attacked).&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;In earlier scenarios to this battle set, you found that the defences in North Norway have collapsed; the Soviet Northern Fleet has put to sea; and Soviet submarines inflicted damage along the US Eastern seaboard. Iceland fell to the Soviets, and an attempt has been made to interdict the Sea and Air Lines of Communications between North America and Europe. The 2&lt;SUP&gt;nd&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet (US) and Strike Fleet Atlantic (2&lt;SUP&gt;nd&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet + NATO forces) heavily supported by USAF and RAF elements have retaken Iceland. A recent Soviet offensive has been halted but casualties were high, you are now retaking the offensive.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;UL style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Please respect the initial ready times for aircraft, this represents designed delays that both balance the scenario and paint the picture of the ongoing conflict.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Points are allotted or deducted for losses, achieving special missions and completing objectives.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;There is a heavy emphasis on logistics in this scenario, players should pay particular attention to fuel and munitions.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;It is strongly advised that you run a separate notepad or spreadsheet to keep track of intelligence and taskings.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Created by Bart Gauvin: AKA Gunner98&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
